Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 15:26:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy: WarmongerHurry candidate flag (the user's
 rule: a warmonger buys only settlers and siege units with gold)

A candidate warmonger's gold purchases of production are allowed only for
settlers and siege units (UNITAI_CITY_BOMBARD or UNITCOMBAT_SIEGE). No
buildings, wonders, projects, workers, work boats, caravans or other combat
units; no exceptions. Faith and tile purchases are unchanged.

The check is in CvCity::IsCanPurchase (gold only), so every purchase path
obeys it; the hurry loop checks too, ahead of VP's investment paths, and
WarChest buys siege units only. A block in a city in danger of falling or
under siege is logged ("WarmongerHurry: blocked X in threatened city Y"),
once per city, item and turn. Off in the bundle. Written 10:27am ET.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj2nf4FeZTEHWjvnhhA
